<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning/actions/addition> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-10-08T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType rim:additionAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning> ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning/actions/identifier-2026-11-17> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The object identifier of this item moves from https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning to https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning, which resolves through w3id.org (decision of 2026-11-17); the register actions of the item move with it, under https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning/actions/. The old IRI is kept as owl:sameAs. The content of the item is unchanged. Classified clarifying: the item is the same, only its identifier changes." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-17T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:affectedProperty rim:objectIdentifier ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning/actions/meaning-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The meaning of the operation moves to the activity type https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/activity-type/point-cloud-thinning, linked by activityType (gp:activityType). The definition no longer defines the operation; it was: \"Reduces the number of points to the given percentage by sequential point removal, which suits points stored in chronological order best.\"" ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning/actions/representation-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The schema copied on each input and output that had one is replaced by the representation that realizes its data type in the data-formats register (decision D6): inputs/points -> point-cloud-las (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentEncoding\": \"base64\", \"contentMediaType\": \"application/vnd.las\", \"description\": \"LAS (OGC 17-030r1); application/vnd.las is the IANA-registered media type\"}); outputs/result -> point-cloud-las (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentEncoding\": \"base64\", \"contentMediaType\": \"application/vnd.las\", \"description\": \"LAS (OGC 17-030r1); application/vnd.las is the IANA-registered media type\"})." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning/actions/sections-restored-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "Corrects what https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning/actions/tools-2026-11-09 describes: the description sections removed then (sources, illustrations, data formats, multiplicity and the open question where present, and the Register position reference to the tier-4 process and its testbed URL) are restored. Tools and testbed stay in the prose; decision D4 applies to the model (keywords, source, properties), which carries none. Decision of 2026-11-09." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning/actions/tools-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "Decision D4: tool keywords removed: Point Cloud Thinning, pointcloud_tools; 2 format keywords removed from inputs and outputs (inputs/points: LAS; outputs/result: LAS); sources removed (tools, testbed, the bbox schema now in the representation's format): SAGA 7.3.0 -- Point Cloud Thinning (Simple) <https://saga-gis.sourceforge.io/saga_tool_doc/7.3.0/pointcloud_tools_9.html>; ZOO-Project Geonovum testbed -- SAGA.pointcloud_tools.9: Point Cloud Thinning (Simple) <https://host1.tb.geonovum.geolabs.fr/ogc-api/processes/SAGA.pointcloud_tools.9>; description rewritten without tool, host or testbed. Each removed tool or testbed reference remains findable at tier 4, in bblocks-process-profiles." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/point-cloud-thinning> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

